{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48845","headline":"六叹 三 · 李涉","name":"六叹 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关东病儒客梁城，五岁十回逢乱兵。\n烧人之家食人肉，狼虎炽心都未足。\n城里愁云不开城，城头野草春还绿。\n五十余年忠烈臣，临难守节羞谋身。\n堂上英髦沈白刃，门前舆隶乘朱轮。\n千古伤心汴河水，阴天落日悲风起。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}